    <string name="sr_n">SR%1$d</string>
    <string name="registers_note_macronix">Macronix: one status register. Amber: a protection bit. Tap a bit to flip it. Clear protection clears BP and SRWD, as -u does, and keeps QE.</string>
    <string name="registers_note">Bit names as on most Winbond-type chips. Amber: a protection bit. Tap a bit to flip it (not WEL, BUSY, SUS, LB or R). Clear protection clears BP, SRP and CMP, as -u does, and keeps QE.</string>
